CONFIRMED STACK (context.md §3, ADR-001)
============================================================

- PHP                    8.4              (~8.4.0)
- laravel/framework      13.33+           (^13.33)
- filament/filament      5.8+             (^5.8)
- livewire/livewire      4.4+             (^4.4)
- spatie/laravel-permission 8.3           (^8.3)
- intervention/image     4.3              (^4.3)
- pestphp/pest           5.2              (^5.2, dev)
- pestphp/pest-plugin-laravel 5.0         (^5.0, dev)
- larastan/larastan      3.12             (^3.12, dev)
- laravel/pint           1.32             (^1.32, dev)
- MySQL                  8.4

EXCLUDED from composer.json:
- laravel/fortify — candidate for stage 4 (MFA) only, via separate PR + ADR.
- bezhansahu/filament-shield — not used; policies handle authorization.

FORBIDDEN:
- Redis, Memcached, SQLite, Supervisor, pcntl, S3/MinIO
- Wildcard `*` in versions
- composer update on production
- restore DB from HTTP admin request (only CLI, context.md §24)
- rollback without compatibility check (context.md §17)

============================================================
ROLES (frontend-spec.md §3.1)
============================================================

- admin   — full access, 2FA required
- editor  — only "Content" group in admin
- user    — authorized player
- guest   — virtual role + tracked via guest_visitors (cookie 30 days)

Matrix: spatie section.{key}.view + guest-JSON in settings.
Middleware: section.access:{key}, registration.open, IdentifyGuest.

